      ],
      "finding": "None and an empty dimension list reduce all axes under the sum default. Signed dimensions are wrapped, out-of-range and repeated normalized axes are rejected, and scalar wrapping admits -1/0. The candidate reuses the original bound sd_axis_mask and si_plan without changing these bodies."
    },
    {
      "id": "no-autograd",
